// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_macos_tmutil_delete_backup.yml
// ID Sigma: 452df256-da78-427a-866f-49fa04417d74
// Título: Time Machine Backup Deletion Attempt Via Tmutil - MacOS
// Descripción: Detects deletion attempts of MacOS Time Machine backups via the native backup utility "tmutil".
An adversary may perform this action before launching a ransonware attack to prevent the victim from restoring their files.

// Aplica a: Producto: macos | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: macos
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\macos\process_creation\proc_creation_macos_tmutil_delete_backup.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "/tmutil" or ProcessCommandLine contains "tmutil") and ProcessCommandLine contains "delete"
